  "referenceNumber": "RUS3675",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that IMO 9326689 (“MERKURIY”) is or is likely to be involved in an activity whose object or effect is to destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. Namely, 9326689 is, or is likely to be\n, involved in carrying liquefied natural gas that originated in Russia from a place in Russia to a third country. \n",
